            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "text": "hello 3"
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "text": "hello 4"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "messages": [
            {
              "role": "user",
              "text": "hello 1"
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "text": "hello 2"
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "text": "hello 3"
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "text": "hello 4"
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "text": "hello 5"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "notes": "Python: tests/test_discussion_core.py::test_a_mark_of_any_other_shape_breaks_no_turn and test_a_mark_the_discussion_did_not_issue_is_ignored. Uses the actual AI channel: malformed or unissued marks neither break model generation nor inject their supplied notes. Authentic retired marks and the unmarked current input ordering are also checked by native tests."
}
